The prebuilt native libraries include third-party Rust components. The exact
component versions, package URLs and license expressions are recorded in
NATIVE_SBOM.cdx.json and NATIVE_CORE_SBOM.cdx.json.

The native dependency set uses the following SPDX license families:

- Apache-2.0
- Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
- MIT
- Unlicense
- Unicode-3.0

The dependency set includes bytes, cesu8, cfg-if, combine, crossbeam-channel,
crossbeam-utils, jni, jni-sys, libc, log, memchr, mio, pin-project-lite,
proc-macro2, quote, same-file, socket2, syn, thiserror, tokio, unicode-ident,
walkdir, wasi, winapi-util, windows-link, windows-sys and windows-targets.

